## Modeling the Calendar

Days of the week are a classic enum — exactly seven values, no more, no less.

### The Day Enum

```xiom
enum Day {
  Monday,
  Tuesday,
  Wednesday,
  Thursday,
  Friday,
  Saturday,
  Sunday,
}

fn main() -> Int {
  let today = Day.Wednesday;
  io.println("Day recorded!");
  return 0;
}
```

### Weekend Checker

```xiom
fn is_weekend(day: Day) -> Bool {
  return match day {
    Saturday | Sunday => true,
    Monday | Tuesday | Wednesday | Thursday | Friday => false,
  };
}

fn main() -> Int {
  io.println(is_weekend(Day.Saturday));  // true
  io.println(is_weekend(Day.Monday));    // false
  return 0;
}
```

### Day Description

```xiom
fn schedule(day: Day) -> Str {
  return match day {
    Monday => "Back to work!",
    Tuesday => "Getting into the groove.",
    Wednesday => "Hump day!",
    Thursday => "Almost there...",
    Friday => "TGIF!",
    Saturday => "Sleep in!",
    Sunday => "Relax and recharge.",
  };
}
```

